  "source_gate": "UR",
  "reason": "Owner decision 2026-10-17: add a fourth AGDF core defect (D4) to this run. A structured run can reach a closeout dead end: QA and UAT approval are possible without TP Review and Clean Implementation Review, but closeout.record requires both with a pass decision, and internalStepEligibility no longer allows recording them once QA or UAT is approved (observed in run mcp-ergonomics-baseline-20261016-01).",
  "intended_change": "Extend the UR with D4: problem statement, goal, scope item, acceptance signal, sources and risks for making the review requirement consistent between QA/UAT readiness and OR closeout (SD decides: block QA presentation without the reviews on structured routes, keep the reviews recordable before closeout, or both) with a regression test for the dead end. D1 to D3 stay unchanged in substance; the summary is updated accordingly.",
