      "type": "UR",
      "path": ".agdf/control/artefacts/core-approval-lock-defects-20261017-01/UR.md",
      "digest": "sha256:27603420814dc502caa8dff5a1e4a2b98312430e32efe32fbcd0bb2962c6f926",
      "statement": "While closing run `mcp-ergonomics-baseline-20261016-01` on 2026-10-16/17, three AGDF core defects surfaced. That run is completed separately; its artefacts, approvals and receipts remain historical evidence and are not changed here.",
      "intended_change": "State four defects and add the D4 problem paragraph (closeout dead end without TP Review and Clean Implementation Review).",
      "reason": "Owner decision 2026-10-17: add a fourth AGDF core defect (D4) to this run. A structured run can reach a closeout dead end: QA and UAT approval are possible without TP Review and Clean Implementation Review, but closeout.record requires both with a pass decision, and internalStepEligibility no longer allows recording them once QA or UAT is approved (observed in run mcp-ergonomics-baseline-20261016-01)."
    },
    {
      "type": "UR",
      "path": ".agdf/control/artefacts/core-approval-lock-defects-20261017-01/UR.md",
      "digest": "sha256:27603420814dc502caa8dff5a1e4a2b98312430e32efe32fbcd0bb2962c6f926",
      "statement": "Each defect is either detected at the earliest point where it can be corrected cheaply, or it no longer occurs:",
      "intended_change": "Add the D4 goal: a structured run cannot be approved past QA into a closeout it can never record; a run already in that state has a governed way to close.",
      "reason": "Owner decision 2026-10-17: add a fourth AGDF core defect (D4) to this run. A structured run can reach a closeout dead end: QA and UAT approval are possible without TP Review and Clean Implementation Review, but closeout.record requires both with a pass decision, and internalStepEligibility no longer allows recording them once QA or UAT is approved (observed in run mcp-ergonomics-baseline-20261016-01)."
    },
    {
      "type": "UR",
      "path": ".agdf/control/artefacts/core-approval-lock-defects-20261017-01/UR.md",
      "digest": "sha256:27603420814dc502caa8dff5a1e4a2b98312430e32efe32fbcd0bb2962c6f926",
      "statement": "4. Implementation happens on the feature branch `fix/agdf-core-approval-defects-20261017` in its own worktree, not on `main`. The owner commits.",
      "intended_change": "Insert the D4 scope item before this item; acceptance signals, sources, risks and the localized summary gain the matching D4 statements.",
      "reason": "Owner decision 2026-10-17: add a fourth AGDF core defect (D4) to this run. A structured run can reach a closeout dead end: QA and UAT approval are possible without TP Review and Clean Implementation Review, but closeout.record requires both with a pass decision, and internalStepEligibility no longer allows recording them once QA or UAT is approved (observed in run mcp-ergonomics-baseline-20261016-01)."
    }
